{"data": [{"author_id": "423769635", "created_at": "2026-11-11T20:38:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120617063412900045"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 130, "id": "22073146", "start": 117, "username": "MikeZaccardi"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/pWW8DafMyB", "end": 154, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SoberLook/status/2120617063412900045/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120617017879203840", "start": 131, "url": "https://t.co/pWW8DafMyB"}]}, "id": "2120617063412900045", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 10212, "like_count": 48, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "China’s earnings growth has fallen short of analyst expectations for nine years in a row.\n\nSource: Goldman Sachs via @MikeZaccardi https://t.co/pWW8DafMyB", "url": "https://x.com/SoberLook/status/2120617063412900045"}, {"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-11-11T19:49:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120604833187049756"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "The central bank says the tool will address systemic liquidity stress without covering institutions’ credit risks or guaranteeing investor returns", "display_url": "caixinglobal.com/2026-11-12/pbo…", "end": 37, "expanded_url": "https://www.caixinglobal.com/2026-11-12/pboc-says-bond-market-facility-wont-bail-out-individual-firms-102503768.html", "images": [{"height": 373, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120604841269428224/z63DWEbL?format=png&name=orig", "width": 560}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120604841269428224/z63DWEbL?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 14, "status": 200, "title": "PBOC Says Bond Market Facility Won’t Bail Out Individual Firms", "unwound_url": "https://www.caixinglobal.com/2026-11-12/pboc-says-bond-market-facility-wont-bail-out-individual-firms-102503768.html", "url": "https://t.co/cU3nqdmApj"}]}, "id": "2120604833187049756", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1688, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "Not stimulus!\nhttps://t.co/cU3nqdmApj", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2120604833187049756"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-11T19:07:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120594341173580156"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/RepDeborahRoss…", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/RepDeborahRoss/status/2120540967010750787", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/VXja1drCso"}]}, "id": "2120594341173580156", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 11, "impression_count": 23298, "like_count": 131, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 6}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120540967010750787", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I feel like the Wikipedia editors aren't doing the readers any analytical favors here by using these two maps. Total voteshare for Dems grew significantly in 2026. The fact that the Democrats won more NC Congressional seats isn't, in and of itself, evidence of a dummmymander. https://t.co/VXja1drCso", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2120594341173580156"}, {"author_id": "702235316812275712", "created_at": "2026-11-11T18:42:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120587929760530735"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/spC22lBNha", "end": 54, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2120587929760530735/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120587927235497984", "start": 31, "url": "https://t.co/spC22lBNha"}]}, "id": "2120587929760530735", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2073, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Future news headline about EA? https://t.co/spC22lBNha", "url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2120587929760530735"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-11T18:33:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120585815029903440"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 20, "start": 16, "tag": "SMH"}]}, "id": "212